{"id":"2b0f7d4c2fc8ba4d","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-borel-measurable-map.md","title":"ZFC Borel Measurable Map","display":"df-zfc-borel-measurable-map — ZFC Borel Measurable Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-borel-measurable-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-borel-measurable-map"],"display":"df-zfc-borel-measurable-map — ZFC Borel Measurable Map","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-borel]]","[[58-df-topological-space]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-zfc-map-preimage]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-borel-measurable-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-borel-measurable-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-borel-measurable-map — ZFC Borel Measurable Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"58-df-borel\">58-df-borel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ff9b8482d2bc3a99\" href=\"?note=ff9b8482d2bc3a99\" title=\"58-df-zfc-map-preimage\">58-df-zfc-map-preimage</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,f\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,f\\in V\\)</span> (topological carriers, topologies, and map graph)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Borel}(B,X,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Borel}(B,X,\\tau)\\)</span> (three-place Borel-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"58-df-borel\">58-df-borel</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMapPreimage}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMapPreimage}_S\\)</span> (preimage-set predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BorelMeasurableMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BorelMeasurableMap}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}borel\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{BorelMeasurableMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall B\\subseteq Y\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Borel}(B,Y,\\tau_Y)\\to\\exists P\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcMapPreimage}_S(P,f,B)\\land\\mathrm{Borel}(P,X,\\tau_X))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}borel\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{BorelMeasurableMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall B\\subseteq Y\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Borel}(B,Y,\\tau_Y)\\to\\exists P\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcMapPreimage}_S(P,f,B)\\land\\mathrm{Borel}(P,X,\\tau_X))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The topologies are explicit parameters, and every inverse image is a set witness supplied by the registered preimage relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-borel","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-borel]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-map-preimage","status":"resolved","id":"ff9b8482d2bc3a99","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-map-preimage]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S$ (topological-space predicate, see [[58-df-topological-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-borel","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Borel}(B,X,\\tau)$ (three-place Borel-set predicate, see [[58-df-borel]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Borel}(B,X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMapPreimage}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BorelMeasurableMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}borel\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{BorelMeasurableMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall B\\subseteq Y\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Borel}(B,Y,\\tau_Y)\\to\\exists P\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcMapPreimage}_S(P,f,B)\\land\\mathrm{Borel}(P,X,\\tau_X))\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1446,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1470","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-borel-measurable-map.md|58-df-zfc-borel-measurable-map]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","9375de7089953a2b","815e63e5071e7b58","36d7463d215be751","ff9b8482d2bc3a99"]}